<p>Author questions:</p>
<ol>
<li>When you feel alone in a group of people, how do you cope?</li>
<li>Do you ever feel too disconnected from the rest of the world?</li>
<li>Why did JJ not care that he left his desktop behind?</li>
</ol>
<p>What I Listened to While Writing: Young Thug's JEFFERY.</p>
<p>EDIT: Also, AO means &quot;Anomalous Object&quot;. I can't remember its first usage or how I found it, but I like that parlance.</p>

